Title:          The Mistral Report: Invisible Affairs
Description:    Espionage-themed turn-based retro RPG
Summary:        The Mistral Report: Invisible Affairs is an espionage-themed turn-based retro role-playing game. Requires 386SX or better. Sound options include Adlib, PCSpeaker and OPL2LPT.
